# miroir is staged but must not reconcile yet: the MiroirNodeGroup points at a
# partition that does not exist until a node's NVMe has been repartitioned, and
# an agent with no usable pool exits and takes the CSI node plugin with it.
# Delete this line once at least one node is converted AND labelled
# storage.dcunha.io/miroir=true -- label first, so the agent finds its pool on
# the first reconcile rather than starting pool-less.
kubernetes/apps/miroir-system/
